@FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@familyId = 265063bd-efbf-4d54-93c0-4c9b634de51f
@targetUserId = a50b0f89-40c3-464e-a9e6-2c47e5564419

### 1. Health check & Swagger
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN
### ========================================================

### 2. Registrar usuario (Admin Inicial / Usuario)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ken",
  "lastName": "Castro",
  "phoneNumber": "0995929826",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 8 Pro",
  "fcmToken": "ken_fcm_token"
}

### 3. Iniciar sesión
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0995929826",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 8 Pro",
  "fcmToken": "ken_fcm_token"
}

### 4. Renovar Token (Refresh Token)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 8 Pro",
  "fcmToken": "ken_fcm_token"
}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE PERFIL DE USUARIO (Cualquier usuario autenticado)
### ========================================================

### 5. Consultar Mi Perfil
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Actualizar Mi Número de Teléfono
PUT {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPhoneNumber": "+593999999111",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### 7. Actualizar Mi Contraseña
PUT {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123*",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword456*"
}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE ADMINISTRACIÓN (Solo Usuarios con Rol 'admin')
### ========================================================

### 8. Listar Todos los Usuarios del Sistema
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Crear Usuario desde Panel Admin
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Gomez",
  "phoneNumber": "+593977777777",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "role": "user"
}

### 10. Eliminar Usuario desde Panel Admin
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE FAMILIAS Y MIEMBROS
### ========================================================

### 11. Crear Grupo Familiar
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Familia Castro"
}

### 12. Listar mis Grupos Familiares
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Obtener Detalle de Grupo Familiar por ID
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Añadir Miembro por Número de Teléfono
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+593988888888",
  "role": "member"
}

### 15. Actualizar Rol de un Miembro de Familia
PUT {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### 16. Eliminar Miembro o Salir del Grupo
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE LOCALIZACIÓN ON-DEMAND (FCM & SIGNALR)
### ========================================================

### 17. Solicitar Ubicación On-Demand (Emite Silent Push a través de FCM)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/request
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": "{{familyId}}",
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

### 18. Reportar Ubicación GPS (Respuesta del dispositivo destino al despertar)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/report
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -0.180653,
  "longitude": -78.467834
}

### 19. Consultar Última Ubicación de un Familiar
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/families/{{familyId}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Consultar Historial de Ubicaciones
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/families/{{familyId}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/history?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
